  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop celery, brown onion and garlic.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977b7939c9c3068924c90/step-8bf14400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook celery and onion stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977b7939c9c3068924c90/step-94a25f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, then add tomato sugo, red wine jus, stock concentrate, lentils, the butter, brown sugar and a splash of water and cook until thickened, 4-6 minutes. Season with a pinch of pepper.\n• Meanwhile, heat a small saucepan over medium heat. Heat light cooking cream until starting to steam, 2-4 minutes. Add half of the Parmesan cheese and whisk until combined and smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977b7939c9c3068924c90/step-288f4120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice fresh lasagne sheets in half widthways.\n• Spoon roughly 1/4 of the lentil filling into a baking dish, follow with 1/4 of bechamel, then top with a fresh lasagne sheet.\n• Repeat with remaining filling, bechamel and lasagne sheets. Finish with a final lasagne sheet, then remaining bechamel.\n• Bake lasagne until filling is bubbling and top is golden brown, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977b7939c9c3068924c90/step-605c5830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When lasagne has 5 minutes remaining, roughly chop cucumber and halve snacking tomatoes (see ingredients).\n• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber, tomatoes, flaked almonds and balsamic vinaigrette dressing. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977b7939c9c3068924c90/step-2fda8840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rich lentil and red wine jus fresh lasagne between plates.\n• Serve with balsamic and almond salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977b7939c9c3068924c90/step-55b3ac50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
